graph TD
    subgraph STM32_Nucleo ["STM32H7 Nucleo (RTOS Producer)"]
        A[FreeRTOS Telemetry Task] -->|Formats Data| B[SPI TX Buffer]
        A -->|Debug Output| UART[UART Debug Console]
        B --> C[SPI Slave Peripheral]
        A -->|Triggers| D[GPIO EXTI Out]
    end

    subgraph Hardware_Bus ["Physical Jumper Wires"]
        C <==>|SPI MISO/MOSI/SCLK/CS| E
        D -->|DATA_READY Signal| F
    end

    subgraph Raspberry_Pi ["Ubuntu Linux 22.04 (Kernel & User Space)"]
        F[GPIO IRQ In] --> G{Linux Hard IRQ}
        G -->|Schedules| H[Workqueue / Bottom Half]
        H --> E[SPI Master Controller]
        E --> I[(Kernel kfifo Buffer)]
        I --> J[Char Device '/dev/telem0']
        J --> K[User-space Logger]
    end
